## 7. Isolamento Multi-Tenant

### 7.1 Global Scope
```php
namespace App\Models\Scopes;

use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Builder;
use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Model;
use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Scope;

class TenantScope implements Scope
{
    public function apply(Builder $builder, Model $model)
    {
        if (auth()->check() && !auth()->user()->is_admin) {
            $builder->where('user_id', auth()->id());
        }
    }
}
```

### 7.2 Trait de Tenant
```php
namespace App\Models\Traits;

trait BelongsToTenant
{
    protected static function bootBelongsToTenant()
    {
        static::addGlobalScope(new TenantScope);
        
        static::creating(function ($model) {
            if (auth()->check() && !$model->user_id) {
                $model->user_id = auth()->id();
            }
        });
    }
}
```

## 8. Sistema de Feature Flags

### 8.1 Service de Features
```php
namespace App\Services;

class FeatureService
{
    public function userCan(string $feature): bool
    {
        $user = auth()->user();
        
        if ($user->is_admin) {
            return true;
        }
        
        return $user->plan->features()
            ->where('slug', $feature)
            ->where('is_enabled', true)
            ->exists();
    }
    
    public function getUserFeatures(): array
    {
        return auth()->user()->plan->features()
            ->where('is_enabled', true)
            ->pluck('slug')
            ->toArray();
    }
}
```

### 8.2 Policy de Features
```php
namespace App\Policies;

class TransactionPolicy
{
    public function create(User $user): bool
    {
        // Verifica se usuário tem acesso à feature
        if (!app(FeatureService::class)->userCan('transactions')) {
            return false;
        }
        
        // Verifica limite de transações do plano
        if ($user->plan->max_transactions) {
            return $user->transactions()->count() < $user->plan->max_transactions;
        }
        
        return true;
    }
}
```